{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39133","headline":"赠云阳裴明府 · 韦庄","name":"赠云阳裴明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南北三年一解携，海爲深谷岸爲蹊。\n已闻陈胜心降汉，谁爲田横国号齐。\n暴客至今犹战鹤，故人何处尚驱鸡。\n归来能作烟波伴，我有鱼舟在五溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}